    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Deltota Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office, on the 16th of January 2017 at 10.30 a.m. and hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 09th of December, 2016, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. U. J. M. S. S. B. JAYASINGHE, Divisional Secretary, Deltota. At Deltota Divisional Secretariat, 24th November, 2016.",
